{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02531","headline":"奉和夏日晚景应诏 · 杨师道","name":"奉和夏日晚景应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辇路夹垂杨，离宫通建章。\n日落横峰影，云归起夕凉。\n雕轩动流吹，羽盖息回塘。\n薙草生还绿，残花落尚香。\n青岩类姑射，碧涧似汾阳。\n幸属无爲日，欢娱尚未央。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨师道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}